#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_coworker__serialize_capabilities
msgid ""
"How ai.tool.capability capabilities are serialized to the LLM. enum = "
"minimal context (good for small models); namespace = parallelism + a shared "
"description. Access (group_ids) applies regardless — filtering happens "
"before serialization."
msgstr ""
"ai.tool.capability 序列化方式：enum 使用较少上下文，适合小模型；namespace 支持并行和共享描述。两者均在序列化前按 "
"group_ids 筛选权限。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_coworker__conference_mechanism
msgid ""
"How conference mode picks the best answer (change ai-orchestration-tidy-up "
"7.3). Can be overridden per call via the conference_mechanism context key."
msgstr ""
"讨论会选择最佳答案的方式（ai-orchestration-tidy-up 7.3），可通过 conference_mechanism "
"上下文参数按次覆盖。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_okf_concept__embedding_state
msgid ""
"How creating the concept vector went. pending = no provider/key at the time;"
" cron fills in. failed = the provider answered but the vector was wrong "
"(wrong dimension) — needs action. skipped = no text to vectorise. Needed so "
"backfill knows what is missing — without the marker an empty column looks "
"the same whatever the reason."
msgstr ""
"概念向量生成状态：pending 表示当时无服务商或密钥，由定时任务补齐；failed "
"表示服务商已响应但向量有误（如维度错误），需要处理；skipped 表示无可向量化文本。便于识别回填缺项，避免把所有空向量都视为同一原因。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ai_agent_core.view_ai_personal_goal_form
msgid "How is progress measured?"
msgstr "如何衡量进度？"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_coworker_session__pi_message_count
msgid ""
"How many entries in the Pi client messages[] are already stored as session "
"lines. Pi sends the WHOLE history on every call; this counter means only NEW"
" messages are persisted (one line per messages[] entry, no duplication)."
msgstr "Pi 客户端 messages[] 中已保存为会话消息的条数。Pi 每次发送完整历史，此计数确保仅保存新增消息，每项一条，不重复。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_model__sys_multiplier
msgid ""
"How many systemtokens 1 real token costs. 1.0 = DeepSeek, 5.0 = GPT-4o, 6.0 "
"= Claude. Includes Vertel margin."
msgstr "每个实际词元对应的系统词元数。1.0 = DeepSeek，5.0 = GPT-4o，6.0 = Claude，包含 Vertel 利润。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
