msgstr "最近生成 OKF 字段的时间。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_coworker__last_successful_run
msgid ""
"When the coworker last ran SUCCESSFULLY. This is a real sign of life — "
"unlike `last_heartbeat`, which is updated on every cron tick even when no "
"run happens (a rotation marker). Delegation uses it for receptiveness "
"(bevakning-over-tid / coworker-delegation)."
msgstr ""
"AI 员工最近一次成功运行的时间，是实际活动指标。不同于每次定时调度都更新的轮转标记 last_heartbeat，委派会据此判断是否可接收任务。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_coworker_session__reply_at
msgid "When the delayed reply should be posted."
msgstr "延迟回复的计划发布时间。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_coworker_session__bifrost_synced_at
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_coworker_session_line__bifrost_synced_at
msgid "When the gateway log was last aggregated."
msgstr "最近汇总网关日志的时间。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_coworker_session_object__datetime
msgid ""
"When the operation was last performed for this object in this session "
"(updated on repeated writes)."
msgstr "本会话最近一次对此对象执行操作的时间，重复写入时更新。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_okf_concept__retention_warned_at
msgid ""
"When the owner was warned that the deadline approaches. Makes the warning "
"one-shot — otherwise it becomes a daily activity nobody reads."
msgstr "向所有者告警即将到期的时间，确保只提醒一次，避免每天生成无人阅读的活动。"

