msgstr "更新时（变更时）"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_agent__runtime
msgid ""
"Where the agent loop runs. \"In the Odoo process\" occupies an Odoo worker "
"during the run; \"External process\" starts the agent as a separate process "
"and frees the worker immediately."
msgstr "智能体循环的运行位置。Odoo 进程内运行会占用工作进程；外部进程模式将其独立启动，并立即释放 Odoo 工作进程。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_memory__memory_type
msgid ""
"Where the content came from. The storage format is always pgvector and is "
"not steered from here."
msgstr "内容来源。存储格式始终为 pgvector，不由此项控制。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_coworker_session__machine
msgid ""
"Where the session ran: the Pi host name when Pi owns the run, otherwise "
"\"Odoo\" (created inside Odoo). Empty on sessions created before the field "
"existed — never guessed."
msgstr "会话运行位置：由 Pi 执行时为 Pi 主机名，否则为 \"Odoo\"。字段创建前的旧会话留空，不进行推测。"

