#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_coworker_session_tool_call__executor
msgid ""
"Where the tool actually ran. Without this it is impossible to answer which "
"tools are used and where — which is exactly the question that decides where "
"the agents should improve."
msgstr "工具实际运行位置，用于分析哪些工具在何处使用，并确定智能体应在哪些环节改进。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_personal_memory__source
