msgstr "此记忆的来源。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_tool__executor
msgid "Where this tool executes. Local = in AgentLoop. NATS = via Pi-agent."
msgstr "工具执行位置：Local 为 AgentLoop 内，NATS 为通过 Pi 智能体执行。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_identity__learning
msgid ""
"Whether coworkers with this identity write OKF concepts from conversations."
