#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_coworker__chat_user_id
msgid ""
"Who owns the coworker automatic runs (cron, mail, watch, webhook)? The owner"
" gets the session experience written to their personal memory. The default "
"is the coworker bot user — it gives isolation. Set a human when the "
"experience should belong to a person. The system user is never accepted."
msgstr ""
"AI "
"员工自动运行（定时、邮件、监控、Webhook）的所有者，其个人记忆接收会话经验。默认为机器人用户以隔离数据；需要归属个人时指定人类用户，不允许使用系统用户。"

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_org_task__beställare_ref
